    "text": "Chester County, Pennsylvania\nEnjoy Scenic Views of Longwood Gardens at the New 1906 Restaurant\nBy Haley Mattes,\n11 hours ago1906 offers visitors a uniquely nature-inspired dining experience with stunning views of Longwood’s Main Garden Fountain. 1906, the newest restaurant at Longwood Gardens, offers residents a dining experience unlike anywhere else in Chester County, writes staff for Premier. The restaurant was built behind the Main Conservatory’s original retaining wall....\n2",
